  "description": "Embark on a retro journey with this set of 12 digital papers featuring vintage pop-art women as 1950s stewardesses, dressed in elegant uniforms and inspired by classic comic book art. \nThese high-resolution PNGs are sized at 3600 x 3600 pixels and 300 DPI, making them perfect for adding a touch of mid-century aviation charm to your creative projects.\nIdeal for crafting cards, scrapbooks, junk journals, and more, these papers bring a stylish and nostalgic twist to your designs.\nUse them to create eye-catching pieces that capture the elegance and allure of 1950s air travel with a vintage pop-art vibe.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Embark on a retro journey with this set of 12 digital papers featuring vintage pop-art women as 1950s stewardesses, dressed in elegant uniforms and inspired by classic comic book art. </p>\n<p>These high-resolution PNGs are sized at 3600 x 3600 pixels and 300 DPI, making them perfect for adding a touch of mid-century aviation charm to your creative projects.</p>\n<p>Ideal for crafting cards, scrapbooks, junk journals, and more, these papers bring a stylish and nostalgic twist to your designs.</p>\n<p>Use them to create eye-catching pieces that capture the elegance and allure of 1950s air travel with a vintage pop-art vibe.</p>",
